        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='53741' id='41' type-v2='text' w='16974' x='658' y='42519'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>Insight(Overall Period)</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial'>1. System load peaked around late 2023–early 2024 and declined sharply through 2025.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial'>2. HHS care load remained higher than CBP custody load for most of the period, making HHS the major contributor to total system load.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial'>3. Net intake was largely negative during 2023, shifted to positive pressure during much of 2024, and moved closer to balance in 2025.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial'>4. Backlog pressure increased during periods of positive net intake, while negative net intake indicated system relief.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f2f6f7' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
